    container PON_SERVICE_CONFIG_PROFILE_ENHANCED_TC_PERF_MON_HIST_DATA {
      description
        "Enhanced TC performance monitoring history data, Class Value 454. This ME collects PM data associated with the XGS-PON and subsequent ITU-T PON systems' TC layer. For a complete discussion of generic PM architecture, refer to clause I.4. ConfigDB table: PON_SERVICE_CONFIG_PROFILE_ENHANCED_TC_PERF_MON_HIST_DATA.";
